  data: {
    LLM: "Talk! Communication is legal. Coordinate with your partner to ensure you don't 'waste' a KarnÃ¶ffel (Unter) on a trick your partner can win with a 4 or 5.\n\nThe 'Devil' Lead: Use the Seven of the elected suit to Lead a trick you MUST win. It is almost unbeatable on the lead, but garbage if held back.\n\nManaging the 'King-beaters': Since the 4 and 5 of trumps can only beat Kings (and lower), use them specifically when you know an opponent is holding a high card but no Master trumps.",
